{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/4d23ad4b08d2ed43b86dc3e0ff290acb.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=398 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/5f97c8292c241daaaa17cfb5968a3db9.avif?t=1760421638\" width=680 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tiny Isle, you'll discover a mysterious sprite civilization and help these creatures rebuild their homeland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this secluded island, you can cultivate magical plants to gather crystals, catch and collect fantastical fish, and attract adorable animal villagers to settle down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through your efforts, this forgotten isle will gradually come alive with vivid lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/8ae867a452fc3ad6e1b59f71940c7897.avif?t=1760421638\" width=680 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Isle is a casual farming game where you can grow adorable crops and build your dream island! Cultivate a variety of cute plants and harvest energy-filled crystals. Use these crystals to expand your island's territory and unlock even more delightful crop varieties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely plant various magical mushrooms, succulents, and flowers to create your perfect island paradise with your unique aesthetic preference. Occasionally, new sprites and animal residents will visit the island. When you meet a companion you like, invite them to settle down in the island and make it their home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for a relaxing, stress-free farming game with delightful cute art, Tiny Isle might just be your perfect match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/b8b1e7a2f9d83e26ecfe5ea5bf66e719.avif?t=1760421638\" width=680 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/2179becfd77202f3208b70c9d0dce3e4.avif?t=1760421638\" width=680 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaeEasy-to-learn gameplay with no complex stats or overwhelming management systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0fFull terrain and decoration customization to create your unique island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8eCultivate crops across your island to harvest Crystals, then spend them to unlock new plant varieties and gradually expand your territory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31Every crop has its own superpower!  Some produce, some deliver, others boost your yields\u2014mix them right to skyrocket your Crystal output!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/2ad38b3c30515b212cb4e05b6ebe3892.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/50303cbb7bff2fa9566e07344890d21a.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/e8de36d08416e46bc0e90edafb886b07.avif?t=1760421638\" width=680 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33In addition to the island's indigenous inhabitants, new residents can also be recruited through tree hollows to temporarily settle on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddda\u200d\u2640\ufe0fEach resident possesses unique appearances and personalities, and they will assist with the island's production in their own distinctive ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0fBecome besties with the locals, and they\u2019ll put down permanent roots on your island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/a23e09768629f67fb55f9471871ea085.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=936 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/11442186a51d69aedb3b9a2133c997a7.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/b14d544bdb2d25c39fd745f712e724ab.avif?t=1760421638\" width=680 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3Cast your line around the island for a relaxing fishing trip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1fReel in all kinds of fish, then\u2014once you've honed your skills\u2014aim to break size records and even challenge legendary Fish Kings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/f9d15618339371ce5fe11fc73d6b8ea6.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/d1efa4bd8612845ce40e62dadfe84c3d.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/ded3186c7d4386fda2b0c8200d2d4048.avif?t=1760421638\" width=680 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0fYour island shifts moods with time and weather\u2014sunny vistas, stormy drama, even magical sky surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/88f3ae08038ebcdd4ad023961bef2081.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/a8aaa81edebf87be0b281593a888b72c.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/931aac560e10215e34da82e73881df7a.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Thank you for your interest and support for <i>Tiny Isle</i>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run into any issues while playing\u2014or if you have fun ideas and creative thoughts to share\u2014you're warmly welcome to join our official <strong><u>Discord</u></strong>. Let\u2019s make this little island even more wonderful, together!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3337180?t=1760421638","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760421638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/f4db6c43aed4a7769cef84eb3b41e1d3bb9d7c3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760421638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/f4db6c43aed4a7769cef84eb3b41e1d3bb9d7c3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760421638","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3486560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/4d23ad4b08d2ed43b86dc3e0ff290acb.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=398 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/5f97c8292c241daaaa17cfb5968a3db9.avif?t=1760421638\" width=680 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tiny Isle, you'll discover a mysterious sprite civilization and help these creatures rebuild their homeland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this secluded island, you can cultivate magical plants to gather crystals, catch and collect fantastical fish, and attract adorable animal villagers to settle down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through your efforts, this forgotten isle will gradually come alive with vivid lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/8ae867a452fc3ad6e1b59f71940c7897.avif?t=1760421638\" width=680 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Isle is a casual farming game where you can grow adorable crops and build your dream island! Cultivate a variety of cute plants and harvest energy-filled crystals. Use these crystals to expand your island's territory and unlock even more delightful crop varieties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely plant various magical mushrooms, succulents, and flowers to create your perfect island paradise with your unique aesthetic preference. Occasionally, new sprites and animal residents will visit the island. When you meet a companion you like, invite them to settle down in the island and make it their home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for a relaxing, stress-free farming game with delightful cute art, Tiny Isle might just be your perfect match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/b8b1e7a2f9d83e26ecfe5ea5bf66e719.avif?t=1760421638\" width=680 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/2179becfd77202f3208b70c9d0dce3e4.avif?t=1760421638\" width=680 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaeEasy-to-learn gameplay with no complex stats or overwhelming management systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0fFull terrain and decoration customization to create your unique island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8eCultivate crops across your island to harvest Crystals, then spend them to unlock new plant varieties and gradually expand your territory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31Every crop has its own superpower!  Some produce, some deliver, others boost your yields\u2014mix them right to skyrocket your Crystal output!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/2ad38b3c30515b212cb4e05b6ebe3892.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/50303cbb7bff2fa9566e07344890d21a.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/e8de36d08416e46bc0e90edafb886b07.avif?t=1760421638\" width=680 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33In addition to the island's indigenous inhabitants, new residents can also be recruited through tree hollows to temporarily settle on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddda\u200d\u2640\ufe0fEach resident possesses unique appearances and personalities, and they will assist with the island's production in their own distinctive ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0fBecome besties with the locals, and they\u2019ll put down permanent roots on your island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/a23e09768629f67fb55f9471871ea085.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=936 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/11442186a51d69aedb3b9a2133c997a7.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/b14d544bdb2d25c39fd745f712e724ab.avif?t=1760421638\" width=680 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3Cast your line around the island for a relaxing fishing trip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1fReel in all kinds of fish, then\u2014once you've honed your skills\u2014aim to break size records and even challenge legendary Fish Kings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/f9d15618339371ce5fe11fc73d6b8ea6.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/d1efa4bd8612845ce40e62dadfe84c3d.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/ded3186c7d4386fda2b0c8200d2d4048.avif?t=1760421638\" width=680 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0fYour island shifts moods with time and weather\u2014sunny vistas, stormy drama, even magical sky surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/88f3ae08038ebcdd4ad023961bef2081.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/a8aaa81edebf87be0b281593a888b72c.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/931aac560e10215e34da82e73881df7a.avif?t=1760421638\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Thank you for your interest and support for <i>Tiny Isle</i>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run into any issues while playing\u2014or if you have fun ideas and creative thoughts to share\u2014you're warmly welcome to join our official <strong><u>Discord</u></strong>. Let\u2019s make this little island even more wonderful, together!</p>","developers":["Nature Rituals Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/header.jpg?t=1760421638","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3337180/330631887/74f11ce1416ddb9f91c90b2b7cec15284b8b2e55/1753427280/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753451061","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3337180/330631887/74f11ce1416ddb9f91c90b2b7cec15284b8b2e55/1753427280/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753451061","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3337180/330631887/74f11ce1416ddb9f91c90b2b7cec15284b8b2e55/1753427280/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753451061","id":257173782,"name":"TinyIsle_Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173782/a79544eb51ef0c3587e0e678dddb8114c898950c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753451061"}],"name":"Tiny Isle","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor